# Gitleaks fingerprints for reviewed findings. Each entry must reference the
# rule it suppresses and stay scoped to one commit/file/line.
#
# Format:
#   <commit>:<file>:<rule-id>:<line>
#
# Only add fingerprints after confirming the match is an intentional public
# value (e.g. anon/publishable keys, documented placeholders) — never to hide
# a real secret. Prefer rotating and removing the secret over ignoring it.
